# The splats' pack growth, held to one set of numbers by both packs: the TypeScript reference in
# packages/splats/src/pack.ts and the core's port in crates/null3d-core/src/chunk_rows.rs. Each
# reads this file and fails when its own growth leaves these figures.
#
# A chunk of 16 rows, and the share of its surface that each prefix covers, from the whole chunk
# down to one row. Index i stands for the prefix that is count / 2^(i/2) rows long.
count 16
coverage 1 0.9 0.8 0.7 0.6 0.5 0.4 0.2 0.05

# prefix growth: the whole chunk draws at its own scales; a half covers 0.8 of the surface and
# grows by its square root's inverse; one row covers a twentieth and would grow past four, so the
# cap holds it at three.
expect 16 1
expect 11 1.0588763607770533
expect 8 1.118033988749895
expect 2 1.5811388300841898
expect 1 3
